<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-23T03:51:45.198Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:51:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels are advancing in eastern DRC, seizing towns and planning a housing project in Goma, while ADF gunmen continue killing civilians in Ituri. Fighting near Ituri has trapped an Ebola response team for over 24 hours, forcing WHO staff to shelter in a maternity ward and prompting WHO to call for evacuation of the team. FRN rebels shot down a DRC military aircraft in South Kivu and Kabila rebels shot down another fighter jet. Kenya and the DRC presidents have agreed to restore diplomatic relations after a meeting in Brazzaville. 1,158 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;TheNigeriaLawyer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPVk1ZMVlrbE1BdGtGdlhzc1RZVDQycXF6NTBIZjBKMTdoRWxYcjZmMk9FY05GZDRCdHA4cndBbVIwSy10VHNBSy1ReDFxVFFERkVNN1NGZUNFLWRkOHZyR2VqQVN5OG5Cc2VNTDctT1BHazVQUDlJc1J0MldPczRudjVFNW1VVEF1TDMxUEtGLXVxTW9tNE9BalZrZWJOd2tZX09TX3VLbkhzOFEyMUxZbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bénin Web TV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE55VS1rNWlrWEtfUVJoSTJsbWJnMnlZeHlDTTJqaFJoN0NGR01zal91YjQtZkhUVUdTdFh5UzVhSVRkT1JqLXVfalA2UnhNZkVwNS1iX0hNX0p2UndoNkNpb0RpYXVWQ2E4akVfZGIydw?oc=5&quot;&gt;RTHK News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxOeTQtbWpSOHlCWUNEM2Y3X1dURmZFS3hJYldsSGt3ZWR3VElyS2lGRTdKQk55VXhENFZGUHlTaXhHWl84dXNwaVhtQlBKLWtCMVMwZENaMW0wY0JPd1pCXzgyenRmMU9KVG5UTmZ2cHNaTUQ0QzZUV0dJczl0NzdQb05FVm9wZE5CdU5JYmhPOVNTMmFvaW1WcXJUZUN